WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.840
Illinois and the city of Chicago are filing a lawsuit against the Trump administration

00:03.840 --> 00:06.260
over deployments of National Guard troops.

00:06.460 --> 00:10.100
Joining us now to comment, White House Deputy Chief of Staff for Policy Stephen Miller.

00:10.100 --> 00:15.360
My question was whether the administration still plans to abide by that judge's order

00:15.360 --> 00:18.480
restricting any National Guard troops from being sent to Oregon.

